{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally and the Job Inquiry"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Today's Job Market"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 15}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Present Perfect Continuous vs. Present Perfect Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use these tenses  to express that an action began in the past and is still going on or has just finished. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect tense</span> mainly to express that an action is completed or to emphasize the result."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Forms:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Regular verbs: form of 'have' + base form of verb + ed"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I have worked at the bakery for six years.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/>Irregular verbs: form of 'have' + past participle of irregular verbs"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I have written a number of books in the last two years.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/>You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect Continuous tense</span> to emphasize the duration or continuous course of an action."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Form:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Form of 'have' + been + base form of verb + ing"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">We have been walking for two hours!</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": " I have been thinking a lot about this question. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have been learning a lot as a freelancer."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have met some designers or architects who also complain about competition in their fields."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Questions Within Sentences"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We often ask for clarification when we are not clear on what the other person is referring to. We ask the other person to be more specific by giving more information. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use questions with sentences to ask for clarification. You ask a question including a sentence within the question, like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense</span>?<br/>Questions with sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification.<br/>Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Main Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Embedded Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you know ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you help me understand ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you explain ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you tell me ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could you tell me why journalism is a good career field in today's job market?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you explain how you manage to succeed so well in your field?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fast-paced"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "many things happening quickly or at the same time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's always a fast-paced environment. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le15ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about different career fields."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to have an eye for detail"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be able to notice, observe"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to have an eye for interesting details."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le15ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "competition"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "two or more people or groups trying to get the same thing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is competition in many sectors, especially in creative jobs.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le15ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to succeed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do very well"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you explain how you manage to succeed?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le15ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, 