etail in order to make stories interesting. I have been learning a lot as a freelancer.", "time": "26500", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le15ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: There is competition in many sectors, especially in creative jobs.  I have met some designers or architects who also say their fields are very competitive.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're right about that!  In my opinion, if you are perseverant, it's possible to make a good livelihood working in this area. Just like artists, new journalists definitely need to create a portfolio of their work. I also think it's very important to maintain good working relationships with your colleagues. Teamwork is crucial nowadays.", "time": "39750", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le15ob05re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le15ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le15ob05re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}